 "description": "Read a public Wikipedia article through the official API with revision, license, sections and a text budget. Ten supported editions; inspect omissions. PAID: 2000 micro-dollar service credits per successful call. First use agent_utilities_prepare for this tool. Requires existing credits and a private Authorization header. Reuse prepared arguments for recovery; a new requestId is a new billable operation.",
